# Product rules

Read and follow [`PRODUCT.md`](../../PRODUCT.md).

When we decide a rule (Orbs, Plans, Someday, Memories, Invite, Auth), write it in that file in the matching section — before or with the code. Do not leave it only in chat.

Taste and language stay in local `ETHOS.md`. Execution order stays in `work-order.mdc`. This is who can leave, what a plan is, how Orbs work.

Never commit `ETHOS.md` or `BACKLOG.md`. **Do** commit `PRODUCT.md`.
